### Code Snippets

```
selector {
property: value !important;
}

---

<html>
<head>
<style>
p {
background-color: yellow 
  !important;
}
#myid {
background-color: blue;
}
.myclass {
background-color: gray;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<p style="background-color:orange;">This is a paragraph.</p>
<p class="myclass">This is a paragraph.</p>
<p id="myid">This is a 
  paragraph.</p>
</body>
</html>

---

